abstract: >-
  Independent DA-AHE reference implementation with a modified k=6 parameter set,
  explicit evidence gates, and separately archived synthetic network and security
  calculations. This software does not establish reproduction of the manuscript's
  original k=3 results, physical-board measurements, or full-system certification.

